# Line endings: normalise to LF in the repository.
#
# `core.autocrlf=true` on its own would store CRLF for every file, and that shows
# up as whole-file diff noise the first time anyone edits from Linux or macOS.
# Stating `eol=lf` once here keeps the history clean on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Exception: stock Windows PowerShell 5.1 reads LF-only scripts unreliably, and
# test/install.ps1 has to run there without a newer PowerShell.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# The built bundle is versioned on purpose: the profile loads lib/, not src/, so
# a fresh clone must be installable without running the build first.
lib/*.js text eol=lf
